  "translate_en|mods/NicksRideableElevators/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_NRE_Options_Sound_Tip": "Plays the call chime, the doors, the arrival ding and the motor as the elevator runs. Purely cosmetic and does not draw zombies.",
