  "translate_en|mods/NicksRideableElevators/common/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox_EN.txt|Sandbox_NRE_LethalEmptyShafts_tooltip": "On by default. When on, every elevator shaft is an open pit on every floor except the one the car is parked at. Calling a car and stepping in as the doors open is always safe, but if you open a shaft door on a floor the car isn't at and walk in, you fall."
